    "Yes, you are the only one who can see this dialog. Therefore it would be great if you could ask your collaborators to stop editing the document, so that once you are finished with the merge, it will not lead to more conflicts.": "是的，您是唯一可以看到此对话框的人。因此，如果您能要求您的协作者停止编辑文档，那就太好了，这样一旦您完成合并，就不会导致更多冲突。",
    "You are currently offline. Please try again when you are back online.": "您目前处于离线状态。请当您重新上线后重试。",
    "You are seeing this merge dialog because you were offline for a long time, and the changes you made to the document while you were offline conflicted with the changes made by other users. So it was not possible to merge your edits in automatically.": "您看到此合并对话框是因为您长时间离线，并且您在离线状态下对文档所做的更改与其他用户所做的更改发生冲突。因此无法自动合并您的编辑。",
    "You can edit the content only in the merge editor in the middle. You cannot edit content in the other two editors.": "您只能在中间的合并编辑器中编辑内容。您无法在其他两个编辑器中编辑内容。",
    "You cannot add yourself to your contacts!": "您无法将自己添加到联系人中！",
    "You will receive a warning when you try to complete a merge without accepting or rejecting all of the changes. You can still proceed to merge the document. If you do that, all the insertions and deletions in the merge editor in the middle will be accepted automatically, and all the insertions and deletions in the offline editor on the right will be ignored.": "",
    "Your access request has been sent to the document owner.": "您的访问请求已发送给文档所有者。",
    "Your Access rights have been modified. You now have %(accessRight)s access to this document.": "您的访问权限已被修改。您现在拥有 %(accessRight)s 对此文档的访问权限。",
    "Your access rights were modified while you were offline, so we cannot save your work to the server any longer, and it is downloaded to your computer instead. Please consider importing it into a new document.": "您的访问权限在您离线时被修改，因此我们无法再将您的工作保存到服务器，而是将其下载到您的计算机。请考虑将其导入到新文档中。",
    "Your document was out of sync and has been reset.": "您的文档不同步并已重置。",
    "Your personal passphrase will still unlock this document. A new random password is generated automatically. Other passphrase users will receive it automatically; non-passphrase collaborators need it shared with them manually.": "您的个人密码仍将解锁此文档。自动生成新的随机密码。其他密码用户将自动收到；非密码短语协作者需要手动与他们共享。",
    "Your session expired while you were offline, so we cannot save your work to the server any longer, but you can download it to your computer instead. Please consider importing it as a new document after logging in.": "当您处于离线状态时，您的会话已过期，因此我们无法再将您的工作保存到服务器，但您可以将其下载到您的计算机上。请考虑在登录后将其作为新文档导入。",
